s a unit vector.","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"19d818f8ecdfc25e423979565165654df309e6994d6190fc58c5abe6c8e7304c"},"seconds":42.74728345870972,"seed":749270829884238951,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve this problem, we need to find the maximum value of the expression \\(\\mathbf{c} \\cdot (\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b})\\) where \\(\\mathbf{a}\\) is a unit vector.\n\nStep 1: Recognize that \\(\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\) is a vector orthogonal to both \\(\\mathbf{a}\\) and \\(\\mathbf{b}\\). The magnitude of \\(\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\) is given by \\(|\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}| = |\\mathbf{a}||\\mathbf{b}|\\sin \\theta\\), where \\(\\theta\\) is the angle between \\(\\mathbf{a}\\) and \\(\\mathbf{b}\\). Since \\(\\mathbf{a}\\) is a unit vector, \\(|\\mathbf{a}| = 1\\), so \\(|\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}| = |\\mathbf{b}|\\sin \\theta\\).\n\nStep 2: The expression \\(\\mathbf{c} \\cdot (\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b})\\) is maximized when \\(\\mathbf{c}\\) is parallel to \\(\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\). The maximum value of the dot product is the product of the magnitudes of \\(\\mathbf{c}\\) and \\(\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\), which is \\(|\\mathbf{c}||\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}|\\).\n\nStep 3: Calculate the magnitude of \\(\\mathbf{b}\\):\n\\[\n|\\mathbf{b}| = \\sqrt{(-1)^2 + 4^2 + 6^2} = \\sqrt{1 + 16 + 36} = \\sqrt{53}\n\\]\n\nStep 4: Calculate the magnitude of \\(\\mathbf{c}\\):\n\\[\n|\\mathbf{c}| = \\sqrt{2^2 + (-7)^2 + (-10)^2} = \\sqrt{4 + 49 + 100} = \\sqrt{153}\n\\]\n\nStep 5: The maximum value of \\(|\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}|\\) is \\(\\sqrt{53}\\) (since \\(\\sin \\theta\\) can be at most 1), so the maximum value of \\(\\mathbf{c} \\cdot (\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b})\\) is:\n\\[\n|\\mathbf{c}| \\cdot |\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}| = \\sqrt{153} \\cdot \\sqrt{53} = \\sqrt{153 \\times 53} = \\sqrt{8109}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the maximum value of \\(\\mathbf{c} \\cdot (\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b})\\) is \\(\\boxed{\\sqrt{8109}}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{\\sqrt{8109}}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
